Value IP_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value MAC (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PHYSICAL_PORT (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*IPv4 Address\s+MAC -> Next
  ^-+ -> Next
  ^\s*${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${PHYSICAL_PORT}\s+${STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
